{"id":"jedenfalls","lemma":"jedenfalls","pos":"adv","rank":686,"glosses":["in any case","definitely"],"ipa":"/ˈjeːdənˈfals/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/ca/De-jedenfalls.ogg/De-jedenfalls.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich gehe jedenfalls nicht.","en":"I'm not going anyway.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},null,{"g":"not"}]},{"text":"Jedenfalls ist das nicht deine Sache.","en":"In any case, it's none of your business.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"your","l":"dein"},{"g":"matter"}]},{"text":"Jedenfalls kannst du ganz beruhigt sein.","en":"In any case, you don't need to worry.","words":[null,{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"entire"},{"g":"to calm down, to quiet","l":"beruhigen"},{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Jedenfalls können wir den Zeitplan nicht ändern.","en":"At any rate, we can't change the schedule.","words":[null,{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"timetable, schedule"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to change, to alter"}]},{"text":"Du irrst dich jedenfalls.","en":"Anyway, you're wrong.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to wander","l":"irren"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},null]}]}